flowchart TB
  REQ[Access request: user, device, destination, port] --> S{AD session on device?}
  S -->|no| DENY[DENY]
  S -->|yes| Q{Device quarantined?}
  Q -->|yes| DENY
  Q -->|no| D{Explicit deny?}
  D -->|yes| DENY
  D -->|no| G{Grant in an access policy?}
  G -->|no| DENY
  G -->|yes| C{Identity, device risk, user risk, VLAN, device type}
  C -->|fail| DENY
  C -->|pass| FW{Firewall API available?}
  FW -->|no| BLOCKED[BLOCKED - no new privileged leases]
  FW -->|yes| T{Inside schedule window? Grant needs approval?}
  T -->|approval| APR[APPROVAL_REQUIRED - second engineer]
  T -->|ok| L[Lease created] --> R[Firewall rule] --> V[Rule verified] --> ACT[ACTIVE until expiry, logoff or risk breach]
